Q: Flex container works differently in different browsers? A: <p>The following example should help solve it (though we didn't use object-fit in this example).
You can optionally set it up without the image DIV's:
<a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/75338057/images-in-a-flex-box-looks-different-in-chrome-and-firefox-how-to-make-them-lo">stack post</a></p>
